    Fix notify_check.mjs marking an order/item notified even when every push failed
    
    Caught this live-testing the GitHub Actions notification workflow: an
    unassigned order got marked notifiedUnassigned=true after its only push
    attempt failed with FCM's NotRegistered error (a stale token), which
    meant it would never be retried even once a valid token was saved. Now
    markNotified is only called when at least one recipient's push actually
    succeeds; if every send fails, the order/item is left unmarked so the
    next run (15 min later) tries again.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

